+# SDL_GPU production pipeline audit — 2026-10-19
+
+The Release renderer catalog was audited on the active SDL_GPU Vulkan device
+after adding the skinned DFM DetailMap shader bundle.
+
+```text
+SDL_GPU production pipeline audit driver: vulkan
+DetailMapMaterial: 8 production pipelines created.
+DetailMapMaterial_Skinned: 8 production pipelines created.
+SDL_GPU production pipeline audit passed: 26 bundles, 3495 pipelines created and released.
+```
+
+The command completed with exit code 0. It verifies that SDL_GPU accepted
+graphics-pipeline creation for the current production shader permutations,
+including both `DetailMapMaterial` variants with their normal-map and
+vertex-lighting features.
+
+Mesa printed `Haswell Vulkan support is incomplete`. This audit does not draw
+retail DFM vertices, bind game textures or prove material output, animation,
+frame performance, or compatibility on a fully supported Vulkan GPU. The game
+renderer still uses its OpenGL path for scene rendering.
